    "retrieval_seconds": 0.3357181839965051,
    "answer_seconds": 5.688994640004239,
    "total_seconds": 6.024772384000244,
    "answer": "- Under **Incident Response Policy**, report the P1 incident to **security@acme.com** or the 24/7 Security Hotline at **1-800-555-CERT**. The incident response team must be engaged within **15 minutes**, and containment must occur within **1 hour**.\n- Under **SLA and Uptime**, a P1 API incident must also be acknowledged within **15 minutes**.\n- Under **Incident Response Policy**, a breach involving personal data requires GDPR supervisory-authority notification within **72 hours**. Affected individuals must be notified without undue delay if the risk is high. Applicable state breach-notification deadlines vary by jurisdiction from **14 to 90 days**.",
