    "answer_seconds": 2.2969246210122947,
    "total_seconds": 2.723983860007138,
    "answer": "Under **Error Codes Reference**, HTTP 429 means the API rate limit was exceeded.\n\nUnder **Rate Limiting**, wait the number of seconds specified in the `Retry-After` header, then retry using exponential backoff with jitter; do not retry immediately. The `X-RateLimit-Reset` header also shows the reset time as a Unix timestamp.\n\nUnder **API Authentication**, the OAuth access token is valid for 3,600 seconds (1 hour).",
